   height  4000: 4 windows of 40.0 million measured points; slope over 0.2 to 1 of the height 1.32587 (0.00008); over 0.5 to 1: 1.32598 (0.00013)
   heights 500 and up, weighted: 1.32591, standard error 0.00004; 4/3 is 179 standard errors above

